<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Apples</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Rocco</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Apples</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4WjtVHFZLBMoPND2Q1ovc6</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.514" end="00:11.569">We're like two apples in a tree</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.569" end="00:14.919">You could say we're meant to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.919" end="00:18.767">Feels like you're from a dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.767" end="00:22.101">'Cause I find it hard to believe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.101" end="00:24.382">That I found ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.382" end="00:28.166">I wanna wrap my arms around ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.166" end="00:30.434">But since I have you here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.434" end="00:33.462">It's looking like I'll probably fall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.462" end="00:36.185">In love with the thought of it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.185" end="00:40.482">So, just, just for tonight, let me be your guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.482" end="00:44.364">If you wanna try, I'll give you my all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.364" end="00:47.697">And I'll hold your hands for hours on end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.697" end="00:51.414">And maybe I could leave with a kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.414" end="00:52.978">Da-da-da-da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.978" end="01:00.978">Da-da, da-da, da-da, da-da, da-ra</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.374" end="01:06.717">Like a summer breeze</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.717" end="01:09.799">You both like to mess up my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.799" end="01:14.331">But I don't really mind when you do it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.331" end="01:16.081">Girl, I sound stupid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.081" end="01:18.863">But when have I held you, kid?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.863" end="01:22.728">I'm just glad that I found ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.728" end="01:26.459">I wanna wrap my arms around ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.459" end="01:28.826">But since I have you here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.826" end="01:31.909">It's looking like I'll probably fall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.909" end="01:34.429">In love with the thought of it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.429" end="01:38.860">So, just, just for tonight, let me be your guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.860" end="01:42.426">If you wanna try, I'll give you my all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.426" end="01:45.809">And I'll hold your hands for hours on end</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.809" end="01:49.392">And maybe I could leave with a kiss</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.392" end="01:51.174">Da-da-da-da</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.174" end="01:55.174">Da-da, da-da, da-da, da-da, da-ra</p></div></body></tt>